cdx-agent (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial Debian packaging (Phase 1 MVP).
  * cdx-agent 0.2.0: inventory, heartbeat, policy-pull, HMAC signing,
    offline spool, full-jitter backoff, Retry-After, JSON logging.
  * Includes systemd service/timer units with NoNewPrivileges hardening.
  * Includes AppArmor profile (usr.bin.cdx-agent).
  * Creates cdx-agent system user via sysusers.d.

